{
 "provenance": "Imported from the original SimGame3PlantUpgrade, SimGame3Plant and SimGame3Farmland tables. upgradeCost on the row for level N is the price of the upgrade FROM level N to level N+1 -- which is why the 39 level-3 rows carry none: level 3 is terminal. risePercent is in hundredths of a percent (2500 = +25%). The affected business type is SimGame3Plant.country 1-5, which maps onto Inspiring/Diligent/Brave/Informed/Unfettered and agrees 39/39 with the effectText already in farm-level-data.json. plots is SimGame3Farmland: 40 plots, the first three free (isBaseUnlock 1), the rest priced in item 4 -- the original Diamond, which Everkai already maps to crystals in lib/opening.mjs. Generated inline (no scripts/ importer: the authoring agent was scoped to lib/farm*).",
