 "limits": "upgradeCost is a bare integer with no currency id, exactly like SimGame3Yield.consume, which Everkai already denominates in farm Knowledge -- so the ladder is charged in Knowledge on that same reading. That mapping is an INFERENCE from the shared table convention, not a recovered currency id. Plot prices carry an explicit id (\"4\"), so those are not inferred.",
